ADDITIONAL NOTES

This software performs automated food-quality estimation. Its outputs are
statistical and heuristic estimates, NOT laboratory measurements, and they do
not constitute food-safety certification or professional advice. The storage
temperature and humidity ranges shipped with the software are configurable
engineering defaults, not medical, legal or regulatory limits. Review them with
a qualified food-safety professional before relying on them.

Optional dependencies carry their own licences. In particular, ultralytics
(YOLO) is AGPL-3.0. Datasets referenced in ml/datasets/README.md each carry
their own terms and are NOT redistributed with this repository.
